1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,002
Kehte hain,

2
00:00:01,002 --> 00:00:07,016
Tanjore ke mandir ki parchhai dopahar mein zameen par girti hi nahi.

3
00:00:07,016 --> 00:00:12,027
Log ise chamatkar kehte hain, kuch log ise sirf kahani.

4
00:00:12,027 --> 00:00:15,034
Sach kahin beech mein chhupa hai.

5
00:00:15,034 --> 00:00:19,043
Is video mein hum sabut ke saath dekhenge,

6
00:00:19,043 --> 00:00:22,050
ki parchhai aakhir jaati kahan hai.

7
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:24,853
Aur parchhai se bhi bada sawal,

8
00:00:24,853 --> 00:00:29,993
mandir ke sabse upar rakha patthar. ASI ke records kehte hain,

9
00:00:29,993 --> 00:00:33,730
gumbad ke neeche granite ka single block hai.

10
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:38,870
Uska wazan lagbhag 80 ton bataya gaya hai. Na crane thi,

11
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:42,140
na truck, phir yeh upar pahuncha kaise?

12
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:47,532
Gaon ki dadi aaj bhi bachchon ko yeh kahani sunati hain.

13
00:00:47,532 --> 00:00:52,435
Ki raja ne aisa mandir banwaya, jo kabhi jhukta nahi,

14
00:00:52,435 --> 00:00:57,827
kabhi tootta nahi. Par dadi ki kahani aur ASI ki report,

15
00:00:57,827 --> 00:00:59,788
hamesha same nahi hoti.

16
00:00:59,788 --> 00:01:03,710
Isliye har baat par hum saaf label lagayenge.

17
00:01:03,710 --> 00:01:07,945
Har panel par aap chhota sa chip dekhenge.

18
00:01:07,945 --> 00:01:12,708
Legend yaani mashhoor kahani, jiska koi likha sabut nahi.

19
00:01:12,708 --> 00:01:18,002
Archaeology yaani kisi sanstha ne khud jaakar dekha aur likha.

20
00:01:18,002 --> 00:01:22,236
Disputed yaani experts aapas mein sehmat nahi. Chaliye,

21
00:01:22,236 --> 00:01:27,000
pehle kahani sunte hain, jaise log sunate aaye hain.

22
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,853
Kahani shuru hoti hai Kaveri nadi ke delta se,

23
00:01:30,853 --> 00:01:33,422
jahan Chola raja raj karte the.

24
00:01:33,422 --> 00:01:35,991
Delta yaani nadi ka woh hissa,

25
00:01:35,991 --> 00:01:40,272
jahan woh samundar se milne se pehle phail jaati hai.

26
00:01:40,272 --> 00:01:42,413
Yahan ki zameen upjau thi,

27
00:01:42,413 --> 00:01:45,410
aur raja ka sapna bahut bada tha.

28
00:01:45,410 --> 00:01:50,612
ASI ke mutabik is mandir ko Rajaraja Chola ne banwaya.

29
00:01:50,612 --> 00:01:55,815
Mandir ke andar Shivling hai, aur upar aasmaan chhoota vimana.

30
00:01:55,815 --> 00:02:01,537
Vimana yaani garbhgriha ke upar uthi hui, seedhiyon jaisi oonchi meenar.

31
00:02:01,537 --> 00:02:05,699
Garbhgriha yaani mandir ka sabse andar ka kamra,

32
00:02:05,699 --> 00:02:07,780
jahan pooja hoti hai.

33
00:02:07,780 --> 00:02:12,673
Ab aati hain woh kahaniyan, jo har guide sunata hai.

34
00:02:12,673 --> 00:02:14,141
Sabse mashhoor kahani,

35
00:02:14,141 --> 00:02:19,034
dopahar mein is vimana ki parchhai zameen par nahi girti.

36
00:02:19,034 --> 00:02:24,417
Log kehte hain, Chola karigar suraj ko bhi maat de gaye.

37
00:02:24,417 --> 00:02:29,310
Par is baat ka koi purana likha sabut nahi milta.

38
00:02:29,310 --> 00:02:30,202
Agli kahani,

39
00:02:30,202 --> 00:02:35,555
upar wala bhaari patthar bahut lambi mitti ki dhalaan se upar gaya.

40
00:02:35,555 --> 00:02:40,909
Kehte hain yeh dhalaan Sarapallam naam ki jagah se shuru hoti thi.

41
00:02:40,909 --> 00:02:45,816
Hathi aur bail patthar ko kheenchte rahe, din ke baad din,

42
00:02:45,816 --> 00:02:47,600
mahine ke baad mahine.

43
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:49,236
Aur aakhri kahani,

44
00:02:49,236 --> 00:02:54,144
is mandir mein aaj tak koi daraar nahi aayi.

45
00:02:54,144 --> 00:02:59,598
Daraar yaani deewar ya patthar mein padi patli si phatan.

46
00:02:59,598 --> 00:03:02,870
Log kehte hain, sadiyon ki baarish,

47
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:07,233
dhoop aur bhookamp bhi ise hila nahi paaye.

48
00:03:07,233 --> 00:03:11,050
Yeh baat sunne mein shaandaar lagti hai.

49
00:03:11,050 --> 00:03:14,876
Toh kahaniyan saamne hain, parchhai, dhalaan aur daraar.

50
00:03:14,876 --> 00:03:19,181
Ab sawal yeh hai ki inmein kitna sach hai.

51
00:03:19,181 --> 00:03:23,007
Iske liye humein kahani sunane walon se hatkar,

52
00:03:23,007 --> 00:03:27,312
naapne walon ke paas jaana hoga. Chaliye dekhte hain,

53
00:03:27,312 --> 00:03:30,660
ASI aur UNESCO ne kya likha hai.

54
00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:33,118
ASI ke records ke mutabik,

55
00:03:33,118 --> 00:03:38,527
mandir lagbhag 1010 CE mein poora hua. CE yaani common era,

56
00:03:38,527 --> 00:03:43,935
wahi saal ki ginti jo hum calendar mein use karte hain.

57
00:03:43,935 --> 00:03:46,885
Raja ne khud iska udghatan kiya,

58
00:03:46,885 --> 00:03:51,310
aur ise apne naam par Rajesvara Peruvudaiyar naam diya.

59
00:03:51,310 --> 00:03:54,153
Yeh baat hum tak pahunchi kaise?

60
00:03:54,153 --> 00:03:57,944
Mandir ki deewaron par khude hue shilalekh se.

61
00:03:57,944 --> 00:04:01,735
Shilalekh yaani patthar par likhe gaye purane record.

62
00:04:01,735 --> 00:04:07,421
Inmein raja ke daan aur mandir ke kaam ka zikr milta hai.

63
00:04:07,421 --> 00:04:12,160
Inhe Thanjavur inscriptions kehte hain, patthar ki diary samajh lijiye.

64
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:18,603
UNESCO ne is mandir ko Great Living Chola Temples naam ke samooh mein rakha hai.

65
00:04:18,603 --> 00:04:23,327
Living yaani aisa mandir jahan aaj bhi roz pooja hoti hai.

66
00:04:23,327 --> 00:04:27,193
Matlab yeh band museum nahi, chalta phirta mandir hai.

67
00:04:27,193 --> 00:04:29,770
Aur ASI iski dekhrekh karti hai.

68
00:04:29,770 --> 00:04:32,253
Ab baat karte hain patthar ki.

69
00:04:32,253 --> 00:04:34,736
Poora mandir granite se bana hai,

70
00:04:34,736 --> 00:04:37,220
jo bahut sakht patthar hota hai.

71
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:41,772
Granite yaani woh patthar jo aap kitchen slab mein dekhte hain,

72
00:04:41,772 --> 00:04:43,428
jise kaatna mushkil hai.

73
00:04:43,428 --> 00:04:47,980
Aur yeh bhaari blocks Kaveri delta ke paar laaye gaye the.

74
00:04:47,980 --> 00:04:53,877
Vimana ke bilkul upar ek gumbad hai, jise shikhara kehte hain.

75
00:04:53,877 --> 00:04:57,629
ASI ke mutabik yeh shikhara octagonal hai,

76
00:04:57,629 --> 00:05:01,381
bilkul traffic ke stop sign jaisi shape.

77
00:05:01,381 --> 00:05:04,597
Aur yeh gumbad granite ke single,

78
00:05:04,597 --> 00:05:09,422
chaukor block par tika hua hai. Chaukor yaani square,

79
00:05:09,422 --> 00:05:11,030
barabar bhujaon wala.

80
00:05:11,030 --> 00:05:15,300
Isi chaukor block ke wazan ko ASI bahut bhaari batati hai,

81
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:18,405
kai hathiyon jitna. Aur ise zameen se uthakar,

82
00:05:18,405 --> 00:05:22,674
vimana ki choti tak le jaana tha. Bina kisi motor ke,

83
00:05:22,674 --> 00:05:24,227
bina kisi crane ke.

84
00:05:24,227 --> 00:05:27,720
Yahi is mandir ka sabse bada engineering sawal hai.

85
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:32,726
Ab agli khaas baat, in patthron ke beech mortar nahi hai.

86
00:05:32,726 --> 00:05:36,822
Mortar yaani woh gaara jo eenton ko jodta hai.

87
00:05:36,822 --> 00:05:39,553
Chola karigaron ne patthar aise kaate,

88
00:05:39,553 --> 00:05:43,194
ki woh aapas mein phans kar jud jaayein.

89
00:05:43,194 --> 00:05:47,290
Ise interlocking kehte hain, bilkul Lego ke tukdon jaisa.

90
00:05:47,290 --> 00:05:52,188
Yahi interlocking mandir ki takat ka raaz maana jaata hai.

91
00:05:52,188 --> 00:05:57,575
Bhookamp aata hai, toh patthar thoda hilte hain, par bikharte nahi.

92
00:05:57,575 --> 00:06:01,494
Jaise kase hue jodon wali lakdi ki kursi,

93
00:06:01,494 --> 00:06:04,432
dhakka sehti hai par girti nahi.

94
00:06:04,432 --> 00:06:09,820
Researchers is lachak ko mandir ki lambi umar se jodte hain.

95
00:06:09,820 --> 00:06:12,440
Toh daraar wali kahani ka kya?

96
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:16,371
Patthar ki har imarat waqt ke saath ghisti hai,

97
00:06:16,371 --> 00:06:18,118
yeh vigyan kehta hai.

98
00:06:18,118 --> 00:06:22,485
Par is mandir ka dhaancha aaj bhi majboot khada hai,

99
00:06:22,485 --> 00:06:25,979
yeh sach hai. Aur kabhi koi daraar nahi,

100
00:06:25,979 --> 00:06:29,910
yeh daava kisi report mein aise nahi likha milta.

101
00:06:29,910 --> 00:06:33,680
Ab aate hain sabse mashhoor daave par, parchhai.

102
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:37,450
Is sawal ka jawab kisi kitaab mein nahi,

103
00:06:37,450 --> 00:06:42,634
seedhe aasmaan mein hai. Thodi si geometry lagegi, par ghabraiye mat.

104
00:06:42,634 --> 00:06:45,461
Main ise utna hi aasaan rakhunga,

105
00:06:45,461 --> 00:06:48,760
jitna chhat par khade hokar dhoop dekhna.

106
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:51,290
Pehle samjhiye parchhai banti kaise hai.

107
00:06:51,290 --> 00:06:54,664
Suraj ki roshni seedhi line mein aati hai.

108
00:06:54,664 --> 00:06:58,881
Jo cheez beech mein aaye, uske peeche roshni nahi pahunchti.

109
00:06:58,881 --> 00:07:03,520
Wahi andhera hissa parchhai hai. Suraj jitna neeche, parchhai utni lambi.

110
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:06,050
Suraj jitna upar, parchhai utni chhoti.

111
00:07:06,050 --> 00:07:09,138
Subah aur shaam suraj neeche hota hai,

112
00:07:09,138 --> 00:07:13,109
toh vimana ki lambi parchhai door tak girti hai.

113
00:07:13,109 --> 00:07:16,638
Yeh aap wahan jaakar khud dekh sakte hain.

114
00:07:16,638 --> 00:07:21,050
Matlab mandir parchhai banata hai, bilkul baaki imaraton ki tarah.

115
00:07:21,050 --> 00:07:25,020
Yahan koi jaadu nahi, seedha suraj ka khel hai.

116
00:07:25,020 --> 00:07:27,132
Ab dopahar ka samay sochiye.

117
00:07:27,132 --> 00:07:30,089
Suraj lagbhag sar ke upar hota hai.

118
00:07:30,089 --> 00:07:36,004
Tab har cheez ki parchhai sikud kar uske pairon ke paas aa jaati hai.

119
00:07:36,004 --> 00:07:41,073
Jaise dopahar mein aapki parchhai aapke joote ke neeche chhup jaati hai.

120
00:07:41,073 --> 00:07:44,030
Mandir ke saath bhi yahi hota hai.

121
00:07:44,030 --> 00:07:49,474
Ab twist dekhiye. Vimana seedha zameen se nahi uthta, woh chaudi,

122
00:07:49,474 --> 00:07:52,443
seedhiyon wali neev par khada hai.

123
00:07:52,443 --> 00:07:55,412
Plinth yaani woh oonchi chaudi platform,

124
00:07:55,412 --> 00:07:58,381
jis par imarat tiki hoti hai.

125
00:07:58,381 --> 00:08:02,835
Aur vimana upar jaate hue patla hota jaata hai,

126
00:08:02,835 --> 00:08:04,320
piramid ki tarah.

127
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:07,529
Toh dopahar ki chhoti parchhai kahan girti hai?

128
00:08:07,529 --> 00:08:10,337
Mandir ki apni chaudi plinth par hi.

129
00:08:10,337 --> 00:08:12,343
Zameen tak pahunchne se pehle,

130
00:08:12,343 --> 00:08:15,953
woh mandir ke hi patthar par simat jaati hai.

131
00:08:15,953 --> 00:08:19,964
Neeche khade aadmi ko lagta hai, parchhai gayab ho gayi.

132
00:08:19,964 --> 00:08:21,970
Asal mein woh wahin hai.

133
00:08:21,970 --> 00:08:27,242
Isliye parchhai nahi girti, yeh adhoora sach hai. Parchhai banti hai,

134
00:08:27,242 --> 00:08:31,555
bas dopahar mein mandir ke bahar dikhayi nahi deti.

135
00:08:31,555 --> 00:08:35,869
Aur yeh bhi karigaron ki samajh ka sabut hai,

136
00:08:35,869 --> 00:08:39,703
chaudi neev aur patla hota shikhar. Chamatkar nahi,

137
00:08:39,703 --> 00:08:41,620
par kamaal zaroor hai.

138
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:46,311
Ab woh sawal, jahan experts khud aapas mein sehmat nahi.

139
00:08:46,311 --> 00:08:51,470
Bada sawal, kya upar ka gumbad sach mein single patthar hai?

140
00:08:51,470 --> 00:08:53,347
ASI ke shabdon mein,

141
00:08:53,347 --> 00:08:57,099
shikhara granite ke single block par tika hai.

142
00:08:57,099 --> 00:09:01,790
Par kuch scholars kehte hain, yeh kahani itni seedhi nahi.

143
00:09:01,790 --> 00:09:05,776
Kuch engineers ka maanna hai ki yeh monolith hai.

144
00:09:05,776 --> 00:09:10,205
Monolith yaani poora ka poora akela, bina jod ka patthar.

145
00:09:10,205 --> 00:09:14,191
Baaki kehte hain, yeh kai patthron ko kaat kar,

146
00:09:14,191 --> 00:09:18,177
itni safai se joda gaya ki single dikhta hai.

147
00:09:18,177 --> 00:09:21,720
Paas se jaanch kiye bina, faisla mushkil hai.

148
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:25,047
Ab ramp ka sawal. Ramp yaani dhalaan,

149
00:09:25,047 --> 00:09:28,849
jaise building mein wheelchair ke liye dhalwaan raasta.

150
00:09:28,849 --> 00:09:32,651
Purani kahani kehti hai, Sarapallam se bahut lambi,

151
00:09:32,651 --> 00:09:35,502
seedhi mitti ki dhalaan banayi gayi.

152
00:09:35,502 --> 00:09:40,730
Us par hathi aur bail patthar kheench kar upar le gaye.

153
00:09:40,730 --> 00:09:46,667
Par kuch scholars aur engineers is seedhi dhalaan par sawal uthate hain.

154
00:09:46,667 --> 00:09:48,152
Unka sawal hai,

155
00:09:48,152 --> 00:09:53,099
itni lambi dhalaan banti kaise aur baad mein hatti kaise?

156
00:09:53,099 --> 00:09:57,552
Isliye kuch log spiral ramp ki baat karte hain.

157
00:09:57,552 --> 00:10:02,500
Spiral yaani mandir ke aaspaas ghoomti dhalaan, jaise pahaadi sadak.

158
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:07,762
Seedhi dhalaan wale kehte hain, lambi dhalaan halki chadhai deti hai,

159
00:10:07,762 --> 00:10:11,111
toh kheenchna aasaan. Spiral wale kehte hain,

160
00:10:11,111 --> 00:10:13,981
ghoomti dhalaan kam jagah leti hai,

161
00:10:13,981 --> 00:10:19,243
aur mandir ke saath upar uthti hai. Har taraf tark hai.

162
00:10:19,243 --> 00:10:23,070
Par kisi ke paas likha hua nakshaa nahi.

163
00:10:23,070 --> 00:10:27,913
Aur Sarapallam wali kahani? Yeh naam log aaj bhi lete hain,

164
00:10:27,913 --> 00:10:31,434
par iska purana likha record humein nahi mila.

165
00:10:31,434 --> 00:10:36,277
Isliye hum ise legend hi kahenge. Ho sakta hai sach ho,

166
00:10:36,277 --> 00:10:41,119
ho sakta hai baad mein judi kahani ho. Sabut aane tak,

167
00:10:41,119 --> 00:10:42,440
sawal khula hai.

168
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,506
Ab sabse bada khalipan.

169
00:10:44,506 --> 00:10:49,671
Kaveri delta ke paar bhaari granite kaise laaya gaya? Naav,

170
00:10:49,671 --> 00:10:55,353
rassi ya lakdi ke rollers? Rollers yaani lakdi ke gol latthe,

171
00:10:55,353 --> 00:10:58,968
jin par bhaari cheez lurhkayi jaati hai.

172
00:10:58,968 --> 00:11:04,650
Us samay ke records mein, yeh tareeka likha hi nahi milta.

173
00:11:04,650 --> 00:11:08,406
Kitne mazdoor lage, kaam kis kram mein hua,

174
00:11:08,406 --> 00:11:12,163
patthar kahan rakhe gaye, yeh bhi saaf nahi.

175
00:11:12,163 --> 00:11:14,041
Ise staging kehte hain,

176
00:11:14,041 --> 00:11:18,267
yaani bade kaam ko hisson mein baant kar karna.

177
00:11:18,267 --> 00:11:22,493
Itne bade kaam mein yeh planning zaroor hui hogi.

178
00:11:22,493 --> 00:11:25,780
Par woh kaagaz abhi tak nahi mila.

179
00:11:25,780 --> 00:11:27,947
Accountant hone ke naate,

180
00:11:27,947 --> 00:11:33,906
mujhe sabse zyada hairani planning par hoti hai. Itna bada kaam,

181
00:11:33,906 --> 00:11:39,323
bina computer, bina spreadsheet. Kisi ne toh hisaab rakha hoga,

182
00:11:39,323 --> 00:11:44,740
patthar ka, mazdoor ka, khane ka. Woh hisaab mil jaaye,

183
00:11:44,740 --> 00:11:47,990
toh bahut bada rahasya khul jaaye.

184
00:11:47,990 --> 00:11:51,520
Aaj bhi yeh mandir Thanjavur mein khada hai,

185
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:53,725
aur roz pooja hoti hai.

186
00:11:53,725 --> 00:11:58,137
Ise log Big Temple ya Periya Kovil bhi kehte hain.

187
00:11:58,137 --> 00:12:02,549
Andar jaakar aap vimana ko neeche se dekh sakte hain.

188
00:12:02,549 --> 00:12:06,520
Gardan peeche karni padti hai, itna ooncha lagta hai.

189
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:11,410
Wahan jaayein toh subah aur dopahar, parchhai khud check kijiye.

190
00:12:11,410 --> 00:12:16,790
Subah lambi parchhai dekhiye, dopahar mein use plinth par simatte dekhiye.

191
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:20,702
Deewaron par khude shilalekh bhi dhyan se dekhiye.

192
00:12:20,702 --> 00:12:23,636
Yahi woh patthar ki diary hai,

193
00:12:23,636 --> 00:12:26,570
jisse humein 1010 wali taareekh mili.

194
00:12:26,570 --> 00:12:28,785
Mandir ke aangan mein ghoomiye,

195
00:12:28,785 --> 00:12:31,886
aur granite ke jod dhyan se dekhiye.

196
00:12:31,886 --> 00:12:35,430
Kai jagah patthar itni safai se jude hain,

197
00:12:35,430 --> 00:12:39,861
ki line mushkil se dikhti hai. Yahin aapko samajh aayega,

198
00:12:39,861 --> 00:12:42,076
interlocking ka matlab kya hai.

199
00:12:42,076 --> 00:12:45,620
Aur shikhara wala sawal bhi aur gehra lagega.

200
00:12:45,620 --> 00:12:49,095
Toh hisaab saaf hai. Parchhai banti hai,

201
00:12:49,095 --> 00:12:53,563
bas dopahar mein mandir par hi simat jaati hai.

202
00:12:53,563 --> 00:12:58,527
Upar ka bhaari patthar sach hai, par woh kaise pahuncha,

203
00:12:58,527 --> 00:13:03,988
yeh ab bhi rahasya hai. Aur Sarapallam ki dhalaan ki kahani,

204
00:13:03,988 --> 00:13:06,470
abhi tak sirf kahani hai.

